# Phase 18 compatibility release gate — 2026-10-18T02:38:43Z

## Scope

- Continued on `phase/19-phase-18-compatibility-release-gate`.
- Completed the `MqClientAdmin.getTopicStatsInfo` source-backed slice against
  the read-only Java 5.5.1 oracle. Added request code 202's typed header,
  `TopicStatsTable`/`TopicOffset` DTOs, Core RPC, invoked Java fixtures, typed
  header/body cross-decode fixtures, and scripted success/null/error/malformed
  response coverage.
- Code committed separately as `e53ad60c` (`feat(admin): add topic stats info
  RPC`). Updated the Phase 17 method matrix and appended evidence to the Phase
  18 release checklist. Phase 18 plan was not modified.
- Preserved the existing unstaged Phase 19 runner/README/differential changes
  and their existing rlog; none were included in this commit.

## Validation

- `cargo test -p rocketmq-classic-protocol --all-features --locked`: passed,
  132 unit tests, all integration targets, 49 doctests.
- `cargo test -p rocketmq-classic-core --test admin_rpc --locked`: passed,
  28 tests.
- Strict all-target/all-feature Clippy for Protocol, Remoting and Core passed.
  The first run found a derivable `Default` implementation on the new private
  DTO fields; deriving it fixed the warning, and the strict rerun passed.
- `mvn -q -f compat/java-reference/pom.xml verify`: passed all 37 scenarios,
  fixture drift checks, 60 typed-header and 14 typed-body cross-decodes.
- `cargo fmt --all -- --check` and `git diff --check`: passed.

